                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Guayaquil,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-08-12">August 12,
                        1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>We, the undersigned, merchants, certify that the present rate of exchange for 90
                    days’ bills on London is $6 65, Ecuadorian currency, per pound sterling.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PEANAR, PERES &amp; OBANIO.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MILLAN, BALLEUR &amp; CO.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>J. VEVEROIHO.</signed></closer>
            </div>
